"Lortch are an Artonan resource-world species with brow ridges; their sex shows in chin ridge width."
"An unhappy lortch sways its head like a cobra."
"Lortch are greeted with a double-handed, cross-armed wave."
"Lortch like darkness and fill their quarters with clicking."
"Lortch customs reject rejuvenation treatments."
"On the Night of Emergence, fish-like things climb from burrows by the thousands."
"Lortch stab them with paired pointy sticks, gorge on the last emergence's stores and store anew."
